{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967670/extras/Gif0.gif?t=1744966354\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oh, no!</strong> Morris lost his engagement ring in the arcade's <strong>most expensive claw machine</strong> and is too broke to buy it back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cupiclaw is a roguelike deckbuilding claw machine game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab, sell and change prizes in order to take on increasingly expensive new machines, until you manage to recover Morris' ring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967670/extras/Separator_Star.png?t=1744966354\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grab and sell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get rich by <strong>grabbing</strong> and <strong>selling</strong> prizes starting from the cheapest machine, but beware of <strong>traps</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967670/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1744966354\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize your prizes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add or remove available prizes</strong> to <strong>build your own combos</strong> and win big! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967670/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1744966354\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge new machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get over obstacles</strong> in various machines until you finally <strong>retrieve Morris' ring!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967670/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1744966354\" /></p>","b